<span id="S4.T2.5.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Number of steps in request <math id="S4.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="req_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">req_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span>
